### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### Crear director
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/directors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Vince Gilligan",
  "nationality": "Estadounidense",
  "birthDate": "1967-02-10",
  "biography": "Creador y director de televisión."
}

### Listar directores
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/directors

### Crear serie - reemplaza el id del director
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/series
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Breaking Bad",
  "releaseDate": "2008-01-20",
  "synopsis": "Drama criminal sobre un profesor de química.",
  "country": "Estados Unidos",
  "seasons": 5,
  "rating": 9.5,
  "status": "FINISHED",
  "directorIds": ["DIRECTOR_ID"]
}

### Listar series con directores
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/series

### Listar series por director
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/directors/DIRECTOR_ID/series
